{
 "_schema": [
  "results_map.json: what each macro and each plotted element of the short paper is computed from.",
  "Read by scripts/results.py (scripts/build_values.py, scripts/make_figures.py use it). Edit by hand; `results.py --prefill` fills every EMPTY 'summary' from 'select' using the run lists (--force overwrites).",
  "",
  "Top level:",
  "  runs_root          directory of the runs (relative to the paper directory): analysis_16_production_runs/runs",
  "  realizations       named lists: 'exp' (the experiment's five), 'ten' (production stages 1 and 3), 'A' (realization A, 'one catalog')",
  "  placeholder_spread half-length of the placeholder bars of Fig. 3 (fig1_budget) as a fraction of the value",
  "  macros             {macro name without backslash: entry}",
  "  series             {figure: {series name: {label, points: {x: entry}} or an entry}}",
  "",
  "Entry fields:",
  "  meaning       one line",
  "  select        what run it needs: {'analysis': <experiment analysis>, 'set': <family>_f<f>_s<s>} (RUNLIST_experiment.yaml, including runs reused from stage 1) or {'production': <run name without /realization_NNN>} (RUNLIST.yaml); a list of two for log10_bayes",
  "  summary       run summary file relative to runs_root, '{R}' standing for the three-digit realization, e.g. 'two_tracers_one_population/both_catalogs/complete/peak_f0p30_s0/realization_{R}/summary.json' (a list of two for log10_bayes: numerator, reference). Empty = not known yet (placeholder).",
  "  field         dotted path into summary.json: 'posterior.H0' (a {median, ci90} block), 'posterior.f_agn', 'posterior.dmu_G', 'membership.mean_r_true_agn', 'ln_evidence.value'; or 'grid.agn' / 'grid.gal' = one class's factor of a hosts_known grid (read from the run's grid/*.h5)",
  "  combine       mean_hw | single | combined | derived | log10_bayes | membership | joint | joint_grid (see results.py)",
  "  stat          single: 'pm' (median^{+}_{-} of the 90% interval) or 'value'; combined: 'pm', 'median_minus_input', 'level_of_input' (percent), 'ul90', 'density'",
  "  realizations  name of a list above or an explicit list (default 'exp'); single/log10_bayes/membership/joint use its first element",
  "  expr          derived: Python expression in other macro names",
  "  fmt           Python format, 'sig2' (two significant figures) or 'floor1' (one decimal, rounded down)",
  "  macro         (series points) the point IS this macro: everything comes from the macro's entry",
  "  placeholder   (series points without a macro) {'value': invented number, 'how': why}; Fig. 4 entries (series fig2, fig3) name the macros their placeholder shapes are built from",
  "",
  "Series: fig_anchor (Fig. 2, joint (H0, f_AGN) of grid runs, 'joint_grid'), fig1a/fig1b (Fig. 3), fig3 (Fig. 4a, b), fig2 (Fig. 4c); the series names keep the first draft's file names.",
  "REAL = every summary file named exists for all realizations of the entry; otherwise the placeholder is used."
 ],
